msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 RX2 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-stellarf4v2.rst:60
#: 23153dde49434a21ad93387baf37fc0e 47195a39590247d6aba2f2c4e4006362
