"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX2 and automatically provides telemetry. Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` to “4”."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 TX2，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设为 “4”。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-stellarf4v2.rst:65
#: 1fe33389486447d0bd04ae3364fd2159 6619a3b6adf84d56b3568b49f6e1dc9f
#: 76832738fcdd489a819de9b391284810 9c97cb96283845a4940c41a7dfe54ae6
#: f0f343d01e684ef19333ce61cdc7a806
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-stellarf4v2.rst:66
#: 0660274e4b6f4ff2b0beefa02548a6b2 57fd24eef2274bd1b4e6bbb7142e1f3c
#: 5f15e17e846040edbdf6017cb2a06e8a 75389130524940b49c2e4cc466877780
#: e50c7b0db7a744b391292d71d275cd69
msgid ""
"StellarF4V2 supports using its internal OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver). External OSD support such as DJI or DisplayPort can be used "
"simultaneously and is preconfigured on SERIAL3 but can be supported on any "
"spare UART. See :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2` for more info."
msgstr ""
"StellarF4V2 支持使用其内置 OSD，设置 OSD_TYPE 为 1（MAX7456 驱动）。DJI 或 DisplayPort 等外部 "
"OSD 可同时使用，已预配置在 SERIAL3 上，也可在任何空闲 UART 上支持。更多信息参见 :ref:`common-msp-osd-"
"overview-4.2`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-stellarf4v2.rst:70
#: 9e1633d09afa4216b02407a0b212af4e bb25aa93d4fc4a6bad7a4c3e5e1bccb5
